Package: paparazzi
Title: Scripted Demo Videos, Screenshots, and Tests for Web Pages
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Garrick", "Aden-Buie", , "garrick@adenbuie.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7111-0077"))
Description: Script polished demo videos and screenshots of anything that
    runs in a web browser, including 'Shiny' apps, 'Quarto' documents, and
    live websites. A pipeable interface built on 'chromote' clicks, types,
    and waits the way a person would. While recording, a cursor glides
    between elements, text is typed one character at a time, and a camera
    zooms and pans to the action. Annotations, callouts, spotlights,
    captions, and redactions follow their elements as the page changes.
    Frame captures to an element or aspect ratio, emulate phones, dark
    mode, and other devices, and write MP4, WebM, or GIF files. Without a
    recording, the same scripts run at full speed as browser tests with
    auto-waiting actions and retrying expectations that work with
    'testthat'.
